
# Photo-Signal Deblur Lab

## Overview
Photo-Signal Deblur Lab is a Numerical Analysis Programming project that demonstrates mathematical image restoration using numerical methods.

It takes an image, applies blur and noise, and attempts to restore the original image using numerical algorithms.

## Features
- Image upload and processing
- Synthetic image generation
- Gaussian noise addition
- Mathematical image deblurring
- MSE and PSNR performance evaluation
- Eigenvalue and condition number analysis
- Interactive Streamlit dashboard
- Restored image download

## Numerical Methods Used

1. Gauss Elimination
2. Gauss-Jordan Method
3. Regularized Least Squares
4. Power Method
5. Inverse Power Method

## Technologies Used
- Python
- NumPy
- Pillow
- Matplotlib
- Streamlit

