## Installation

Install the required libraries:

```bash
python -m pip install -r requirements.txt
```

## Run the Dashboard

```bash
python -m streamlit run app.py
```

## Run the Command Line Version

```bash
python main.py
```

## Performance Metrics

- MSE: Measures the average squared difference between images.
- PSNR: Measures reconstructed image quality.
- Condition Number: Indicates numerical sensitivity of a matrix.

## Limitations

This project uses a simplified mathematical blur model and is designed for educational demonstration. Restoration quality depends on noise and regularization settings.

## Project Purpose

To demonstrate how numerical analysis algorithms can be applied to digital image restoration.
